{
  "kings2.4.p1.b1": {
    "text": "「你仆人—我丈夫死了……现在有债主来，要取我两个儿子作奴仆。」",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:1"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "「你仆⁠人—我丈⁠夫死⁠了……现⁠在有债主来，要取我两个儿⁠子作奴⁠仆。」"
  },
  "kings2.4.p1.b2": {
    "text": "「我可以为你做什么呢？你告诉我，你家里有什么？」",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "「我可⁠以为你做什⁠么呢？你告⁠诉我，你家⁠里有什⁠么？」"
  },
  "kings2.4.p1.b3": {
    "text": "「婢女家中除了一瓶油之外，没有什么。」",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "「婢⁠女家⁠中除⁠了一瓶油之⁠外，没⁠有什⁠么。」"
  },
  "kings2.4.p1.b4": {
    "text": "「你去，向你众邻舍借空器皿，不要少借……」",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "「你去，向你众邻舍借空器⁠皿，不⁠要少借……」"
  },
  "kings2.4.p2.b1": {
    "text": "于是，妇人离开以利沙去了，关上门，自己和儿子在里面；儿子把器皿拿来，她就倒油。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "于⁠是，妇⁠人离⁠开以利⁠沙去⁠了，关上⁠门，自⁠己和儿⁠子在里⁠面；儿⁠子把器⁠皿拿⁠来，她就倒油。"
  },
  "kings2.4.p2.b2": {
    "text": "「再给我拿器皿来。」",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "「再给我拿器⁠皿来。」"
  },
  "kings2.4.p2.b3": {
    "text": "「再没有器皿了。」",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "「再没⁠有器⁠皿了。」"
  },
  "kings2.4.p2.b4": {
    "text": "油就止住了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "油就止⁠住了。"
  },
  "kings2.4.p3.b1": {
    "text": "一日，以利沙走到书念，在那里有一个大户的妇人强留他吃饭。此后，以利沙每从那里经过就进去吃饭。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "一⁠日，以利⁠沙走⁠到书念，在那⁠里有一⁠个大户的妇⁠人强留他吃⁠饭。此⁠后，以利⁠沙每从那⁠里经⁠过就进⁠去吃⁠饭。"
  },
  "kings2.4.p3.b2": {
    "text": "「我看出那常从我们这里经过的是圣洁的神人。」",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:9"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "「我看⁠出那常从我⁠们这⁠里经⁠过的⁠是圣⁠洁的神人。」"
  },
  "kings2.4.p3.b3": {
    "text": "「我们可以为他在墙上盖一间小楼，在其中安放床榻、桌子、椅子、灯台……」",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:10"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "「我⁠们可⁠以为他⁠在墙上盖一间小楼，在其⁠中安⁠放床⁠榻、桌⁠子、椅⁠子、灯⁠台……」"
  },
  "kings2.4.p4.b1": {
    "text": "「你既为我们费了许多心思，可以为你做什么呢？」",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "「你既为我⁠们费⁠了许⁠多心⁠思，可⁠以为你做什⁠么呢？」"
  },
  "kings2.4.p4.b2": {
    "text": "「我在我本乡安居无事。」",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "「我⁠在我本乡安⁠居无⁠事。」"
  },
  "kings2.4.p4.b3": {
    "text": "「她没有儿子，她丈夫也老了。」",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:14"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "「她没⁠有儿⁠子，她丈⁠夫也老⁠了。」"
  },
  "kings2.4.p4.b4": {
    "text": "「明年到这时候，你必抱一个儿子。」",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:16"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "「明⁠年到这时⁠候，你必抱一⁠个儿⁠子。」"
  },
  "kings2.4.p4.b5": {
    "text": "「神人，我主啊，不要那样欺哄婢女。」",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:16"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "「神人，我主啊，不⁠要那⁠样欺哄婢⁠女。」"
  },
  "kings2.4.p5.b1": {
    "text": "「我的头啊，我的头啊！」",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "「我⁠的头啊，我⁠的头啊！」"
  },
  "kings2.4.p5.b2": {
    "text": "「把他抱到他母亲那里。」",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "「把他抱到他母⁠亲那⁠里。」"
  },
  "kings2.4.p5.b3": {
    "text": "孩子坐在母亲的膝上，到晌午就死了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:20"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "孩⁠子坐⁠在母⁠亲的膝上，到晌⁠午就死⁠了。"
  },
  "kings2.4.p5.b4": {
    "text": "他母亲抱他上了楼，将他放在神人的床上，关上门出来……",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他母⁠亲抱他上⁠了楼，将他放⁠在神人⁠的床⁠上，关上⁠门出⁠来……"
  },
  "kings2.4.p6.b1": {
    "text": "「今日不是月朔，也不是安息日，你为何要去见他呢？」",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:23"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "「今⁠日不⁠是月朔，也⁠不⁠是安⁠息⁠日，你为⁠何要去见他呢？」"
  },
  "kings2.4.p6.b2": {
    "text": "「平安无事。」",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:23"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "「平⁠安无⁠事。」"
  },
  "kings2.4.p6.b3": {
    "text": "「你平安吗？你丈夫平安吗？孩子平安吗？」",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "「你平⁠安吗？你丈⁠夫平⁠安吗？孩⁠子平⁠安吗？」"
  },
  "kings2.4.p6.b4": {
    "text": "「平安。」",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "「平⁠安。」"
  },
  "kings2.4.p7.b1": {
    "text": "「由她吧！因为她心里愁苦，耶和华向我隐瞒，没有指示我。」",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "「由她吧！因⁠为她心⁠里愁⁠苦，耶⁠和⁠华向我隐⁠瞒，没⁠有指⁠示我。」"
  },
  "kings2.4.p7.b2": {
    "text": "「我何尝向我主求过儿子呢？我岂没有说过，不要欺哄我吗？」",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:28"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "「我何尝向我主求过儿⁠子呢？我岂没⁠有说过，不⁠要欺哄我⁠吗？」"
  },
  "kings2.4.p7.b3": {
    "text": "「我指着永生的耶和华，又敢在你面前起誓，我必不离开你。」",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:30"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "「我指着永⁠生的耶⁠和⁠华，又敢⁠在你面⁠前起⁠誓，我必不离⁠开你。」"
  },
  "kings2.4.p7.b4": {
    "text": "基哈西先去，把杖放在孩子脸上，却没有声音，也没有动静。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "基哈西先⁠去，把杖放⁠在孩⁠子脸上，却⁠没⁠有声⁠音，也⁠没⁠有动⁠静。"
  },
  "kings2.4.p8.b1": {
    "text": "以利沙来到，进了屋子，看见孩子死了，放在自己的床上。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:32"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "以利⁠沙来⁠到，进了屋⁠子，看⁠见孩⁠子死⁠了，放⁠在自⁠己的床⁠上。"
  },
  "kings2.4.p8.b2": {
    "text": "他就关上门，只有自己和孩子在里面，他便祈祷耶和华……",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:33"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他就关上⁠门，只⁠有自⁠己和孩⁠子在里⁠面，他便祈⁠祷耶⁠和⁠华……"
  },
  "kings2.4.p8.b3": {
    "text": "……孩子的身体就渐渐温和了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "……孩⁠子的身⁠体就渐⁠渐温⁠和了。"
  },
  "kings2.4.p8.b4": {
    "text": "孩子打了七个喷嚏，就睁开眼睛了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:35"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "孩⁠子打了七⁠个喷⁠嚏，就睁⁠开眼⁠睛了。"
  },
  "kings2.4.p9.b1": {
    "text": "「你叫这书念妇人来……」",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:36"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "「你叫这书念妇⁠人来……」"
  },
  "kings2.4.p9.b2": {
    "text": "「将你儿子抱起来。」",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:36"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "「将你儿⁠子抱起⁠来。」"
  },
  "kings2.4.p9.b3": {
    "text": "妇人就进来，在以利沙脚前俯伏于地，抱起她儿子出去了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:37"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "妇⁠人就进⁠来，在以利⁠沙脚前俯⁠伏于地，抱⁠起她儿⁠子出⁠去了。"
  },
  "kings2.4.p10.b1": {
    "text": "以利沙又来到吉甲，那地正有饥荒。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:38"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "以利⁠沙又来⁠到吉甲，那地正有饥⁠荒。"
  },
  "kings2.4.p10.b2": {
    "text": "「你将大锅放在火上，给先知门徒熬汤。」",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:38"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "「你⁠将大⁠锅放⁠在火上，给先⁠知门⁠徒熬⁠汤。」"
  },
  "kings2.4.p10.b3": {
    "text": "「神人哪，锅中有致死的毒物！」",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:40"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "「神人哪，锅中⁠有致⁠死的毒⁠物！」"
  },
  "kings2.4.p11.b1": {
    "text": "有一个人从巴力·沙利沙来，带着初熟大麦做的饼二十个，并新穗子……送给神人。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:42"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "有⁠一个⁠人从巴力·沙利⁠沙来，带着初熟大⁠麦做⁠的饼二⁠十个，并新穗⁠子……送⁠给神人。"
  },
  "kings2.4.p11.b2": {
    "text": "「这一点岂可摆给一百人吃呢？」",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:43"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "「这一⁠点岂可摆给一⁠百人吃呢？」"
  },
  "kings2.4.p11.b3": {
    "text": "「你只管给众人吃吧！因为耶和华如此说，众人必吃了，还剩下。」",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:43"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "「你只⁠管给众⁠人吃吧！因⁠为耶⁠和⁠华如⁠此说，众⁠人必吃⁠了，还剩⁠下。」"
  },
  "kings2.4.p11.b4": {
    "text": "他们吃了，果然还剩下，正如耶和华所说的。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Kings 4:44"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他⁠们吃⁠了，果⁠然还剩⁠下，正⁠如耶⁠和⁠华所说⁠的。"
  }
}
